== Spire Shield ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Spire Shield}}
{{Keyword Infobox|Back Attack}}
Spire Shield is an [[Elite]] enemy found exclusively in [[Act 4]].

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Spire Shield}}

Every three turns, starting from turn 3, it uses {{Int|Spire Shield|Smash}}.

Otherwise has a 50/50 chance of using:
* {{Int|Spire Shield|Bash}} followed by {{Int|Spire Shield|Fortify}}
* {{Int|Spire Shield|Fortify}} followed by {{Int|Spire Shield|Bash}}

=== Found With ===
==== Act 4 ====
* {{M|Spire Spear}} on the right side of the player.

== Spire Spear ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Spire Spear}}
{{Keyword Infobox|Back Attack}}
Spire Spear is an [[Elite]] enemy found exclusively in [[Acts#Act 4:The Ending|Act 4]].

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Spire Spear}}

Always starts with {{Int|Spire Spear|Burn Strike}}.

Every 3 turns, starting from turn 2, it uses {{Int|Spire Spear|Skewer}}.

Otherwise has a 50/50 chance of using:
* {{Int|Spire Spear|Burn Strike}} followed by {{Int|Spire Spear|Piercer}}
* {{Int|Spire Spear|Piercer}} followed by {{Int|Spire Spear|Burn Strike}}

=== Found With ===
==== Act 4 ====
* {{M|Spire Shield}} on the left side of the player.

== Notes ==
* The player begins this elite combat with the [[Debuff]] {{KW|Surrounded}}. This only serves as a telegraph for their {{KW|Back Attack}} mechanic and does not actually add any damage bonus.
** {{P|Smoke Bomb}} cannot be used while {{KW|Surrounded}}

